## 1. Data Controller

Lonside Corp. is the controller of your personal data. For any questions, please contact our Data Protection Officer (DPO) at dpo@welqo.fr. We will respond within 48 business hours.

## 2. Collected Data

We only collect data necessary to provide our Airbnb concierge services:

- Identification: Last name, first name, email address, phone number.
- Reservation: Stay dates, number of guests, property features.
- Payment: Financial data is securely processed by Stripe.
- Navigation: IP address, technical cookies, traffic data.

## 3. Purposes of Processing

Your data is processed for the following purposes:

- Managing and billing your bookings.
- Sending check-in instructions and essential transactional info.
- Optimising user experience and website performance.
- Complying with Welqo's legal and accounting obligations.

## 4. Legal Basis

Processing is based on contract performance, your consent for non-technical cookies, and compliance with our legal obligations.

## 5. Data Retention

Your booking data is retained for 5 years. Marketing emails are deleted after 3 years of inactivity. Analytical cookies have a lifespan of maximum 13 months.

## 6. Your Rights

In accordance with GDPR, you have the right to access, rectify, delete, restrict, and export your data. Contact dpo@welqo.fr. For unresolved disputes, you may contact the CNIL.
